{"lang":"zh","dir":"ltr","title":"Chateau Barber Shop | 纳帕市中心免预约理发店","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">跳到主要内容</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C</span><span>Chateau Barber Shop</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">关于我们</a><a href=\"#services\">服务</a><a href=\"#team\">理发师</a><a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a><a href=\"#gallery\">照片</a><a href=\"#reviews\">评价</a><a href=\"#visit\">营业时间和地址</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"语言\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\" selected>中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\">致电</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/storefront.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">理发店 · 纳帕市中心 · 始于 2005 年</p>\n    <h1>Chateau Barber Shop</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">纳帕市中心的免预约理发店。精剪、修胡子和直刃剃刀手艺，先到先得。</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.9 · Google 上的 122 条评价<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 致电本店</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%2C%201521%203rd%20St%2C%20Napa%2C%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 导航</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>在 Third St 20 年</li><li>免预约，先到先得</li><li>只收现金</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">122 条评价，4.9★</a></li><li>纳帕市中心</li><li>无障碍通道</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">我们的故事</p><h2>二十年的剪发与情谊。</h2><p>店主 Santysouk &quot;San&quot; Yankee 来自老挝，在那里学会了男士剪发和造型，并开过自己的发廊。她于 2001 年来到美国，在萨克拉门托读了理发学校，并在已故丈夫的支持下，于 2005 年 6 月在 1521 Third St.（原 Phil&#39;s Barber Shop 店址）开了 Chateau Barber Shop。</p><p>二十年后，这里已是纳帕最主要的理发店之一，排队常常排到门外，熟客从索诺玛、瓦列霍甚至旧金山专程而来。拿手项目是精剪、修胡子、直刃剃刀修面和线条修饰。无需预约：进门找个位子坐下，成为我们大家庭的一员。</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.9★</b><span>122 条评价</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>20 年</b><span>在 Third St</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>2005</b><span>San 开店</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/shop-floor.jpg\" alt=\"Chateau Barber Shop 店内\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">拿手项目</p><h2>我们的服务</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>标准剪发</h3><span class=\"price\">$35</span></div><p>精剪、经典绅士发型以及最新潮流发型。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>儿童（10 岁及以下）和长者（65 岁以上）</h3><span class=\"price\">$25</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>胡子</h3></div><p>修剪和造型胡子。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>直刃剃刀修面</h3></div><p>经典直刃剃刀配热毛巾修面。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>线条修饰</h3></div><p>用直刃剃刀修出干净利落的线条和轮廓。</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">本店没有在网上公布价目表。只收现金。如有疑问，请致电 (707) 255-7662。</p></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"team\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">团队</p><h2>理发椅后的人</h2><p>可以指定 San，也可以坐下一张空椅。</p></div><div class=\"team\"><article class=\"member\"><div class=\"member-head\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">S</div><div><h3>San</h3><p>Santysouk Yankee · 2005 年起任店主</p></div></div><p class=\"member-bio\">San 来自老挝，在那里练就一身手艺，2001 年移民美国。她 90% 的顾客每周到每月都会回来。</p></article></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">温馨提示</p><h2>设施与须知</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>只接待到店顾客</b><span>先到先得，不接受预约</span></li><li><b>只收现金</b></li><li><b>无障碍通道</b></li><li><b>路边停车和停车场</b><span>位于 Church St/4th St 与 School St 之间</span></li><li><b>欢迎小朋友</b><span>小朋友可以挑一根棒棒糖</span></li><li><b>隔壁就有吃的</b><span>Winston’s 就在隔壁</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">相册</p><h2>店内</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/storefront.jpg\" alt=\"Chateau Barber Shop 店面和理发店旋转灯柱\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/side-part.jpg\" alt=\"经典侧分\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/shop-floor.jpg\" alt=\"理发椅和装框照片\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fresh-cut.jpg\" alt=\"刚剪好的发型，正面和侧面\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/logo-sign.jpg\" alt=\"Chateau Barber Shop 招牌\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/before-after.jpg\" alt=\"剪发前后对比\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/chairs.jpg\" alt=\"店内\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/classic-cut.jpg\" alt=\"经典短发\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">媒体报道</p><h2>San 自述</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“My business has grown tremendously from initially being an unknown barbershop with just myself cutting hair to being one of the main barbershops in Napa. Through excellent customer reviews and word of mouth, I have been able to grow my business into what it is today.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Napa Valley Register</b> · San Yankee, “Cuts and camaraderie,” Apr 22, 2025 · <a href=\"https://napavalleyregister.com/business/san-yankee-chateau-barber-shop-napa/article_6afa35bb-180f-421f-8b1f-81a082fc4950.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“Having Winston’s next door has helped many people find my barber shop. Also, sometimes while waiting in line for a haircut customers will stop by Winston’s for something delicious to eat. We love being neighbors with them”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Napa Valley Register</b> · San Yankee, Apr 22, 2025 · <a href=\"https://napavalleyregister.com/business/san-yankee-chateau-barber-shop-napa/article_6afa35bb-180f-421f-8b1f-81a082fc4950.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“We have people coming from Sonoma, Vallejo and sometimes even San Francisco”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Napa Valley Register</b> · San Yankee, “Chateau Barber Shop celebrates decade of service,” Dec 15, 2015 · <a href=\"https://napavalleyregister.com/business/chateau-barber-shop-celebrates-decade-of-service/article_26fc57db-4550-588f-8a20-742de348c257.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">评价</p><h2>顾客怎么说</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 122 条评价</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Google 上查看更多评价 →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">5.0</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 145 条评价</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Yelp 上查看更多评价 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“People typically wait for the owner, but Andrea would always give a perfect cut, spending the time to pay close attention to detail. I like that a bald fade was truly a bald fade when coming here, some places arent willing to fully shave down to the skin when asked. This place was my go-to while living in the area and was always worth the drive for me. Miss coming here and will definitely go back when Im local.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“San, is great with kids when I first started taking my son there he was two and a half He&#39;s 15 now Love this place super quick super professional and does a great job !!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Adam W. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Mar 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“It is absolutely fabulous the owner&#39;s been cutting my hair for the past 15 years”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“San has been doing my hair since I was young and I&#39;ve had 4 people ever doing my hair and she has done the best she is my favorite barber ever!and I totally recommend this barber shop.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Nikolas R. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“San is an amazing barber always friendly and can get you feeling brand new. If you are having a bad day go get a haircut but keep the negativity at home. If busy you should wait it&#39;s worth it.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jul 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“There&#39;s a long line, it&#39;s cash only and they have $30 haircuts; kids 10 and under, and seniors 65 and older $25. San is skilled and did an excellent job quickly.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Wayne G. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Jul 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“San is amazing! I’ve been coming here for 10+ years. It’s First Come First Serve but she is efficient! After the first time I came she remembered my style. She’s the best. People wait for her for a reason.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“San is the best in the business always delivers a fresh cut. Good prices Wait time not bad. Street parking and a parking lot. Downtown Napa.”</blockquote><figcaption>— John T. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Feb 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“We found our new spot to take my 5 year old for an amazing, quick, friendly, and stylish cut! San was amazing with my son and he loved getting to pick his own lollipop.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jul 2020</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">常见问题</p><h2>常见问题解答</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>可以预约吗？</summary><p>不可以，我们只接待到店顾客，先到先得。有时会排到门外，但我们觉得值得等。</p></details><details><summary>只收现金吗？</summary><p>是的，只收现金。</p></details><details><summary>剪发多少钱？</summary><p>标准剪发约 $35，10 岁及以下儿童和 65 岁以上长者有优惠价（约 $25）。价格可能会有变动，请致电 (707) 255-7662。</p></details><details><summary>营业时间是什么时候？</summary><p>周二至周五上午 9 点至下午 6 点，周六上午 9 点至下午 4 点营业。周日和周一休息。</p></details><details><summary>在哪里停车？</summary><p>附近有路边停车位和停车场。我们在纳帕市中心 1521 3rd St。</p></details><details><summary>店开了多久了？</summary><p>我在 2005 年 6 月开了 Chateau Barber Shop，2025 年 6 月 1 日我们庆祝了开业 20 周年。</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">欢迎光临</p>\n      <h2>营业时间和地址</h2>\n      <address>1521 3rd St<br>Napa, CA 94559</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\">(707) 255-7662</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>星期一</td><td>休息</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>星期二</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>星期三</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>星期四</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>星期五</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>星期六</td><td>9 AM – 4 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>星期日</td><td>休息</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">只接待到店顾客，不接受预约。只收现金。</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/the_chateau_barbershop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg><span>@the_chateau_barbershop</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/293242531597152\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2H8v4h2v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V8z\"/></svg><span>Facebook</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Yelp</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google reviews</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .